        # **2 Offline Venues & Zero-FOUT Font Stacks**: Ensuring presentations render identically without internet connectivity.
        #
        # **The Problem:**
        # Conference Wi-Fi is notoriously unreliable. Presenters who rely on `@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/...')` face Flash of Unstyled Text (FOUT), slow slide initialization, or outright styling failures when captive portals block external font downloads.
        #
        # **The Sunstone Solution:**
        # All built-in Sunstone themes (`generic`, `nordic`, `brutalist`, `academic`, `tokyo-night`) prioritize multi-platform native system font stacks:
        #
        # ```css
        # /* Sans Stack: Instant rendering on Windows, macOS, Linux, and Android */
        # --sunstone-font-sans: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
        #
        # /* Mono Stack: Razor-sharp code rendering across all operating systems */
        # --sunstone-font-mono: 'JetBrains Mono', 'Fira Code', 'Cascadia Code', Consolas, Menlo, Monaco, monospace;
        # ```
        #
        # Your presentations load in under 10 milliseconds, look stunning offline, and never depend on external network availability.
        #
